格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 安卓通用控制端：Termux 引导、一键部署、内置浏览器与存储管理（dsh-plugin 生态）","id":"gh:1335355937","install_available":false,"language":"Java","name":"deepseek-harness-android-app","slug":"Jensen-Yao/deepseek-harness-android-app","topics":["agent-harness","android","android-app","cli-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","mobile-ai","termux"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 安卓通用控制端：Termux 引导、一键部署、内置浏览器与存储管理（dsh-plugin 生态）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🤖 DeepSeek Harness Android App"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**把 DeepSeek Harness 装进你的安卓手机 —— 从零到跑起来，全程点按完成，无需命令行**\n**Install DeepSeek Harness on your Android ph"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"one — zero to running, tap-only, no command line**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文 · English · 截图 / Screenshots · 存储位置 / Storage"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 📸 截图 / Screenshots"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| 服务控制 Control | 部署向导 Deploy wizard | 部署进度 Deploy progress |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| 内置浏览器 Built-in browser | 存储管理 Storage manager | 浏览器选择器 Browser picker |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"🇨🇳 中文 · 点击收起中文说明"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## ✨ 特性（中文）"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| 能力 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| 🧭 **Termux 引导安装** | 自动识别机型与架构（arm64/armv7/x86），App 内直接下载匹配的 Termux 安装包并调起系统安装器 |\n| 🚀 **一键部署** | 自动"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"测速选择最快软件源（清华/北外/中科大等 7 源）→ 安装工具链 → 编译原生模块 → 启动服务，全程实时日志 |\n| 📟 **三通道日志** | 部署日志从第 0 秒起同步显示在 App（脚本心跳上"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"报 / 早期进度服务 / 控制守护进程三通道） |\n| 🌐 **内置浏览器** | WebView 内直接使用 Harness，顶部工具栏支持返回/前进/刷新/外部打开 |\n| 🎛 **服务控制** "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"| 启动 / 停止 / 重启 / 状态监控 / 日志查看，全在手机点按完成 |\n| 🔛 **Termux 开关** | 从 App 内直接启动或关闭 Termux（关闭需确认，连同 dsh 服务一并停"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"止） |\n| 📁 **存储管理** | 查看/编辑 harness 全部数据（会话、附件、技能、MCP 配置档案）；单项或**统一数据根**一键迁移到共享存储 |\n| 🧭 **浏览器选择** | 外部"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"打开 Harness 可选择任意已装浏览器（默认 Via，可选系统默认） |\n| 🔋 **防冻结引导** | 按机型（ColorOS/鸿蒙/MIUI/OriginOS/One UI）提示电池优化设置路"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"径 |\n| 🔧 **自服务更新** | 手机端守护进程可经 App 一键更新，不依赖电脑 |\n| 🎨 **Apple 设计语言** | iOS 系统色板、大标题负字距、弹簧动画（阻尼/响应参数化）、按"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"下变暗+震动、触觉反馈、减少动态效果适配 |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 📦 快速开始（中文）"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> 只需一次：把 `install/dsh-harness.apk` 传到手机并安装（微信/QQ/数据线/网盘均可）。之后的每一步都在 App 内完成。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"1. 打开 **DeepSeek Harness** App →「部署」页\n2. 点「下载 Termux 安装包」（自动按机型匹配、自动选最快源）→「安装 Termux」\n3. 点「一键部署 Deep"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"Seek Harness」→ 等待 5~15 分钟（日志实时滚动）\n4. 出现「✓ 部署完成」→「打开 Harness」→ 填入 DeepSeek API Key，开始使用 🎉"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> 若自动部署被系统拦截（部分 ColorOS/鸿蒙机型），App 会自动弹出「粘贴部署」万能通道：一键复制命令 → 打开 Termux 粘贴回车，效果相同。"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"🇬🇧 English · click to expand English description"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## ✨ Features (English)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Capability | Description |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| 🧭 **Termux setup wizard** | Detects device model & ABI (arm64/armv7/x86), downloads the matching T"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ermux APK in-app and launches the system installer |\n| 🚀 **One-click deploy** | Auto speed-tests 7 m"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"irrors (TUNA/BFSU/USTC…) → installs toolchain → compiles native modules → starts the service, with l"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ive logs |\n| 📟 **Triple-channel logs** | Deploy logs visible in-app from second zero (script heartbe"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"at push / early progress server / control daemon) |\n| 🌐 **Built-in browser** | Use Harness directly "},{"id":"p19s6","text":"in a WebView with back/forward/reload/open-externally toolbar |\n| 🎛 **Service control** | Start / st"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"op / restart / status / logs — all tap-only on the phone |\n| 🔛 **Termux on/off** | Start or shut dow"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"n Termux from the app (shutdown asks for confirmation and stops the dsh service too) |\n| 📁 **Storage"},{"id":"p19s9","text":" manager** | Browse/edit all harness data (sessions, attachments, skills, MCP profile patches); per-"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"item or **unified data root** one-tap migration to shared storage |\n| 🧭 **Browser picker** | Open Ha"},{"id":"p19s11","text":"rness in any installed browser (default Via, system default optional) |\n| 🔋 **Anti-freeze guide** | "},{"id":"p19s12","text":"Model-aware battery-optimization instructions (ColorOS/HarmonyOS/MIUI/OriginOS/One UI) |\n| 🔧 **Self-"},{"id":"p19s13","text":"service update** | The phone-side daemon can be updated from the app itself — no PC required |\n| 🎨 *"},{"id":"p19s14","text":"*Apple design language** | iOS palette, large-title negative tracking, parameterized spring animatio"},{"id":"p19s15","text":"ns, press-darken + haptics, reduced-motion support |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 📦 Quick start (English)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> One-time setup: transfer `install/dsh-harness.apk` to the phone and install it (WeChat/QQ/USB/clou"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"d all work). Everything else happens inside the app."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. Open the **DeepSeek Harness** app → 「部署 / Deploy」tab\n2. Tap 「下载 Termux 安装包」 (auto model-matched, "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"fastest mirror) → 「安装 Termux」\n3. Tap 「一键部署 DeepSeek Harness」 → wait 5–15 min (live scrolling logs)\n4"},{"id":"p22s3","text":". When 「✓ 部署完成」 appears → 「打开 Harness」 → enter your DeepSeek API Key 🎉"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> If auto-deploy gets blocked (some ColorOS/HarmonyOS devices), the app pops a universal “paste depl"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"oy” channel: one-tap copy the command → paste into Termux and press Enter — same result."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 🏗 架构 / Architecture"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 📁 存储位置 / Storage locations"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Harness 全部数据位于单一数据根 **`~/.dsh`**（源码 `@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths`，可由 `DSH_HOME` 覆盖）· All harness dat"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"a lives under one root **`~/.dsh`** (see `@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths`; overridable via `DSH_HOME`):"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| 数据 Data | 路径 Path |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| 凭证 Credentials | `~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml` |\n| 设置 Settings | `~/.dsh/settings.yaml` |\n| 会话 Sessio"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ns | `~/.dsh/sessions/<项目 project>/<会话 session>/session.jsonl[.zstd]` |\n| 会话缓存/工作区 Session cache/wor"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"kspace | `~/.dsh/storages/*.json` |\n| 附件 Attachments | `~/.dsh/attachments/v1/objects/<sha256[:2]>/<"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"sha256>` |\n| 用户技能 User skills | `~/.dsh/skills`（另有 `~/.agents/skills`、项目级 `.dsh/skills`） |\n| MCP 配置 "},{"id":"p29s5","text":"MCP config | `~/.dsh/profiles/` 配置档案 profile patches（`cordis.patch.yml` 等） |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"App「关于 → 存储位置」可浏览/编辑以上全部，并支持**统一数据根**一键迁移到 `/sdcard/dsh-data/`（软链接回原位，harness 无感知）· The app's 「About"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" → Storage」 can browse/edit all of the above and migrate everything under one data root to `/sdcard/"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"dsh-data/` (symlinked back, invisible to the harness)."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
